  "name": "74HC161 4-bit counter",
  "category": "logic",
  "description": "Presettable synchronous 4-bit binary counter with asynchronous master reset (74HC161): counts on CP rising while CEP and CET are high, loads D0-D3 while PE_N is low; TC is high at 15 with CET.",
